        "original_id": "0ebbd5eb-a524-58a9-8387-2136f9e34381",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tove Jansson\n- Products: Comet in Moominland, Moomins and the Comet Chase\n- Topics: Moomin books, The Moomins TV series\n\nFacts:\n- In 1943, Tove Jansson held her first solo art exhibition.\n- Comet in Moominland is the second book in Tove Jansson's Moomin series.\n- Comet in Moominland has the Swedish titles \"Kometjakten,\" \"Mumintrollet på kometjakt,\" and \"Kometen kommer.\"\n- The Moomins TV series ran from 1977 to 1982.\n- Moomins and the Comet Chase is a 2010 3D stop motion animated fantasy adventure comedy family film.\n- Moomins and the Comet Chase was compiled from Comet in Moominland-based episodes of The Moomins TV series.\n- The Moomins TV series was animated at Se-ma-for in Poland.\n- Moomins and the Comet Chase was restored and re-soundtracked with multiple voice actors replacing the original single narrator.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
